          <span class="text-orange">How might we</span>{" "}
          <ruby>help<rt>Action</rt></ruby>{" "}
          <ruby>micro-entrepreneurs<rt>Users</rt></ruby>{" "}
          {/* The goal clause starts its own line. Without the break it began
              mid-line and ran onto the next, which left its label stranded
              between the two lines it belonged to. */}
          <br class="hidden desktop:inline" />
          <ruby class="hmw-goal"
